"Cumplir obligaciones legales, contables, fiscales o de seguridad que "
"resulten aplicables."
msgstr ""
"Comply with applicable legal, accounting, tax, or security obligations."

#: .\templates\pages\privacy_policy.html:100
msgid "Base legal"
msgstr "Legal basis"

#: .\templates\pages\privacy_policy.html:102
msgid ""
