"gestionada."
msgstr ""
"We process your personal data when necessary for the performance of the "
"contractual or pre-contractual relationship with you, for compliance with "
"applicable legal obligations, on the basis of your consent where required, "
"and in certain cases on the basis of our legitimate interest in keeping the "
"platform secure, operational, and properly managed."

