"Cuando el tratamiento se base en tu consentimiento, podrás retirarlo en "
"cualquier momento, sin que ello afecte a la licitud del tratamiento "
"realizado con anterioridad a su retirada."
msgstr ""
"When processing is based on your consent, you may withdraw it at any time, "
"without affecting the lawfulness of processing carried out prior to its "
"withdrawal."

