"implicar accesos internacionales a datos. En esos casos, adoptaremos las "
"garantías adecuadas exigidas por la normativa aplicable."
msgstr ""
"However, some technical providers used to operate the platform may be "
"located outside the European Economic Area or involve international access "
"to data. In such cases, we will implement the appropriate safeguards "
"required by applicable regulations."

#: .\templates\pages\privacy_policy.html:142
msgid ""
