"solicitarla escribiendo a info@exploideo.com."
msgstr ""
"If you would like more information about the safeguards applied in each "
"case, you can request it by writing to info@exploideo.com."

#: .\templates\pages\privacy_policy.html:149
msgid "Conservación de datos"
msgstr "Data retention"

#: .\templates\pages\privacy_policy.html:151
