"mientras sean necesarios para prestarte el servicio, gestionar reservas, "
"atender incidencias o cumplir obligaciones legales."
msgstr ""
"We will retain your personal data while your account remains active or as "
"long as it is necessary to provide the service, manage bookings, handle "
"incidents, or comply with legal obligations."

#: .\templates\pages\privacy_policy.html:154
